 d reliable autonomous systems are characteristic intersections. The 2027 
 review process emphasizes a scientifically developed robotic hypothesis t
 hrough gated initial and invited final submissions.\nAdditional topics: P
 lanning & Search\, Deep Representation Learning\, Probabilistic\, Causal 
 & Uncertainty ML\, Robustness & Safety\nScope sources (2027): https://rob
 oticsconference.org/information/cfp/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
